# Weight Loss Tracker iOS App

An iOS application for tracking weight loss progress with goals, charts, and milestone notifications.

## Features
- 4-digit PIN authentication
- Weight entry tracking with timestamps
- Data retention for 6 months
- Chart visualization of weight trends
- Milestone notifications

