## Getting Started

1. Open `ios-weight-loss-app/WeightLossApp.xcodeproj` in Xcode
2. Configure signing and capabilities
3. Build and run the application

## Implementation Status

This project implements the iOS weight loss tracking application as specified in the requirements. The application includes all core functionality:
- PIN authentication system
- Weight entry management
- Data persistence using UserDefaults
- Chart visualization
- Goal tracking
- Notification system

## Building and Running

To build and run the iOS app:
1. Open the Xcode project
2. Select a simulator or connected device
3. Press the Run button or Cmd+R

## Requirements

- Xcode 15 or later
- iOS 17 or later
- Swift 5.9 or later